  "the_equations": {
    "PDE1": "THE RESPONSE - g = nu(|g_tot| / g-dagger) x g_bar, nu(y) = 1 / (1 - e^-sqrt(y)) (EQS-001 designated form). The response never falls below the baryonic value: minimum nu = 1.0 over a 200,001-point scan of y in [1e-8, 1e12]. ARGUMENT FORK CARRIED, NOT MERGED (EQS-002): the baryonic-argument reading g = nu(g_bar / g-dagger) x g_bar is the filed SPARC convention inside the Master Force Law (EQS-342 FO2); a design seat must declare which composition it uses",
