    "PDE3": "THE PERSISTENCE FLOOR - V_p^4 = G M_bar g-dagger; V_p = (G M_bar g-dagger)^(1/4) (ICM-034, designated Law of Persistence). Filed-convention prices (ICM-034 constants): 35.5263 / 63.1758 / 112.3442 / 167.9937 / 199.7793 / 237.5790 km/s at 1e8..2e11 Msun, 355.2635 at 1e12 - accord with ICM-034 at deviation 0.0. Dispersal is forbidden for any M_bar > 0; kill K1 locked (outer rotation below 0.8 V_p where a_bar < 0.1 g-dagger)",
    "PDE4": "THE ENVIRONMENT - an embedded system keeps boost_env = sqrt(nu(g_env / g-dagger)) and G_eff = nu(g_env / g-dagger) x G (EQS-001 VII; ICM-034 step 4; ICM-035 S4). Solar-neighborhood anchor (CEGU-010, g_env 2.127e-10): nu = 1.3589, boost = 1.1657, G_eff = 1.3589 G. Published Gaia anchor (2.32e-10): nu = 1.3315, boost = 1.1539. The isolated limit is governed by PDE2, not by this face",
    "PDE5": "THE CLOCKED FORCE SCALE - g-dagger(rho) = kappa1 c H0 rho^-2 / (2 pi), kappa1 = 1.1514128187269888 computed in-run from g-dagger(0) = 1.20e-10 and H0 = 67.4: g-dagger = 2.4605e-6 at z 1100, 1.3869e-9 at z 6.5, 1.20e-10 today, 9.9318e-11 terminal - the force scale ends at a floor, never at zero (EQS-340 FO1/FO5)",
    "PDE6": "THE SHELL IDENTITY - every baryonic system carries a_nu = sqrt(G M / (23.3896 g-dagger)), r* = sqrt(G M / g-dagger), r2 = sqrt(G M / (0.463 g-dagger)) with r*/a_nu = 4.8363 and r2/r* = 1.4696 at every mass, and the floor and the onset are one fact: V_p^2 a_nu / (G M) = 0.20677, deviation 0.0 over the computed ladder (ICM-055)",
    "PDE7": "THE STRUCTURE GATE - a region is a structure iff rho x R >= 3 g-dagger / (4 pi G) (spherical form, EQS-001 XIII): the threshold is 0.42923 kg/m2 today and 0.35525 kg/m2 at the terminal state; a design body either crosses its onset or it is not a structure in the filed sense",
    "PDE8": "THE DEPTH CHANNEL - Kd = 8.164101435697802e15 x sqrt(rho_bar / 5514); split = (1/2) ln Kd; I = E - split; and the surface channel g_s = G M^(1/3) (4 pi rho_bar / 3)^(2/3) scales as Kd^(4/3) at fixed mass: fixed-mass log-log slope 1.333333333333333 in-run, direct-vs-closed deviation 4.22e-15 over 500 random bodies (EQS-1030 GRV2/GRV3)",
    "PDE9": "THE ARRANGEMENT - under the clock every body lifts by the same +ln rho in E and in split, so I and every pairwise spacing are conserved (51 bodies x 9 stations: max |dI| 2.84e-14, spacings deviation <= 1.78e-15), and the two universe faces obey Kd_U x g-dagger = 1.2192e-9 m/s2 at every station (max rel deviation 2.22e-16): a persistence design's configuration cannot be rearranged by time (EQS-1031 GRVC3/GRVC4)",
    "PDE-U1 (candidate)": "THE DESIGN READING - a persistence design is specified by (M_bar, the g_bar profile, g_env, rho_bar, the clock state) and returns (nu, g, V_p, boost_env / G_eff, the three shells, g_s, the register seat). Its persistence is a FLOOR CONDITION - response never below baryonic (PDE1), deep speed held at V_p (PDE3), structure across onset (PDE7), arrangement invariant under the clock (PDE9) - not a cancellation of gravity: this is the architecture's defiance as filed at ICM-034, refusal of dispersal. The equations specify the floor, the shells and the gates; they do NOT specify an actuator or mechanism. CANDIDATE - naming word his"
